Reference: Contract Modification #1 to Contract #7504for Fire Station Guaranteed Maximum
Price (GMP)
1.Attached to this memo is Contract Modification#1to Contract#7504(AIA
DocumentA133-2019Exhibit A, Guaranteed Maximum Price Amendment).
2.Theintended purpose of this Contract Modification is to get total price for the
construction costs of three fire stations.
